  "given_answer": "2024",
  "answer": "2024",
  "given_solution": "【分析】本题考查了代数式求值，整式的运算，利用换元法代入求值并掌握整式的运算规则是解题的关键．由\\(a+b=2\\)可知\\(a=2-b\\)，将其代入多项式，化简即可计算出答案．\n【详解】\\(\\because a+b=2\\)\n\\(\\therefore a=2-b\\)\n\\(\\therefore a ^ { 2 } -b ^ { 2 } +4b+2020\\)\n\\(=(2-b) ^ { 2 } -b ^ { 2 } +4b+2020\\)\n\\(=4+b ^ { 2 } -4b-b ^ { 2 } +4b+2020\\)\n\\(=2024\\)\n故答案为：2024．",
  "given_solution_figures": [],
  "solution": "\\(\\because a+b=2\\)\n\\(\\therefore a=2-b\\)\n\\(\\therefore a ^ { 2 } -b ^ { 2 } +4b+2020\\)\n\\(=(2-b) ^ { 2 } -b ^ { 2 } +4b+2020\\)\n\\(=4+b ^ { 2 } -4b-b ^ { 2 } +4b+2020\\)\n\\(=2024\\)\n故答案为：2024．",
  "solution_steps": [
    "\\(\\because a+b=2\\)",
